{"id":"00534","root":"uni00534_1","name":{"ja":"アンネローゼ・ヴァジュラ","en":"Annerose Vajra"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"アンネローゼ・ヴァジュラ","en":"Annerose Vajra"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2021-11-30","limited":false,"characterId":316,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の支配階級の男と人間の女の間に生まれたハーフ。伝説の魔刀・金剛夜叉を駆る魔女剣客。人間界と魔界のほとりで探偵業を営む。アミダハラの有力者に顔がきき、彼女と友好的なものもいれば、恨みを持つものも少なくない。剣客の中では最も天下無双に近い剣士として名を轟かせている。フェンシングのような剣術の構えが特徴。お酒好き。特技は“魔女の勘”。","en":"She is a half-breed, born to a man from the ruling class of the Demon Realm and a human woman. She is a witch swordswoman who wields the legendary magic sword, Kongouyasha. She runs a detective agency on the border of the Human Realm and the Demon Realm. She has connections with the powerful people of Amida, and while some are friendly towards her, others hold grudges. She is known as the most unbeatable swordswoman among her peers, with a fencing-like stance that is her trademark. She loves alcohol, and her special skill is her \"witch's intuition\"."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"向井れん","forms":[{"id":"uni00534_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1074,2148],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[221,442],"def":[132,264],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","1300004"]},{"id":"uni00534_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1548,3096],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[367,734],"def":[189,378],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","1300004","1300005"]},{"id":"uni00534_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2022,4055],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[513,1028],"def":[246,493],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","1300004","1300005","1300006"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":